WEBVTT

00:04.860 --> 00:06.940
Yuna Sis!

00:06.940 --> 00:09.530
Aren't you supposed to work 
at the royal capital today?

00:09.530 --> 00:11.650
You'll be late if you don't wake up.

00:13.620 --> 00:17.370
I really don't want to escort any students.

00:17.370 --> 00:21.080
I'm sure that the kids of nobles, 
powerful families, and rich people

00:21.080 --> 00:23.700
are all good-for-nothings.

00:23.700 --> 00:26.380
I definitely won't get along with them.

00:25.650 --> 00:28.500
You can't act so selfishly, Yuna Sis.

00:28.500 --> 00:30.590
Didn't you already accept the job?

00:31.590 --> 00:33.700
Mommy Fina is too strict.

00:33.700 --> 00:34.890
Goodness...

00:45.270 --> 00:47.530
Good morning, Yuna Sis!

00:48.920 --> 00:50.780
Good morning, Fina...

02:29.180 --> 02:32.140
Miss Yuna! Long time no see!

02:32.140 --> 02:33.790
Yeah, long time no see.

02:33.790 --> 02:38.570
I'm so happy that you're escorting us 
on our hands-on training.

02:39.090 --> 02:42.520
Well, Miss Ellalaura asked me to help.

02:42.940 --> 02:45.370
Let me go over the details one more time.

02:45.370 --> 02:49.740
Your job will be to escort the students 
during their outdoor field training.

02:49.740 --> 02:52.130
However, self-preservation 
is also part of their training

02:52.130 --> 02:56.070
so try not to interfere unless you 
think the students are in danger.

02:56.410 --> 02:59.160
Another part of the job 
is observing the students.

02:59.160 --> 03:03.380
Report things like when 
they look down on people,

03:03.380 --> 03:07.870
or act impertinently toward their young 
and exceptionally talented escort.

03:08.980 --> 03:14.460
Just making sure, have you informed 
the academy about me properly?

03:19.880 --> 03:21.390
Um...

03:21.770 --> 03:26.600
My mother definitely explained things 
to the teachers and students.

03:27.690 --> 03:28.570
What'd she say?

03:28.570 --> 03:30.650
She explained that you've 
hunted tiger wolves, orcs,

03:30.650 --> 03:33.660
and other large monsters by yourself.

03:33.660 --> 03:37.530
You're a young female adventurer that 
the guild anticipates will have a bright future.

03:37.530 --> 03:41.240
I'm not sure about any anticipated futures, 
but nothing sounds wrong with that.

03:43.770 --> 03:48.700
So, everyone is expecting 
a cool lady adventurer...

03:48.700 --> 03:50.270
Hold on, what?

03:50.270 --> 03:52.840
No! I'm actually a bear, though!

03:52.840 --> 03:54.380
Uh, Miss Ellalaura?!

03:54.380 --> 03:56.600
I didn't say anything that wasn't true.

03:56.600 --> 03:59.050
You didn't tell them I'm a bear, did you?

03:59.050 --> 04:03.480
They'll definitely talk badly about me 
if they see me like this, right?!

04:03.480 --> 04:04.530
Right?!

04:04.530 --> 04:05.710
I'm sorry.

04:05.710 --> 04:08.560
I want to see how the students react.

04:08.560 --> 04:11.420
Just like a certain girl 
who underestimated Yuna at first

04:11.420 --> 04:13.950
and challenged her to a fight...

04:15.880 --> 04:19.960
And Shia, I'd like you to 
do the hands-on training

04:19.960 --> 04:22.560
while acting like you don't know Yuna.

04:22.560 --> 04:23.280
What?!

04:23.670 --> 04:27.690
There are times when leaders must 
keep quiet about certain things.

04:27.690 --> 04:30.820
You need to seal the information 
within your heart,

04:30.820 --> 04:33.330
while keeping those around 
you happy and agreeable.

04:33.890 --> 04:36.330
You are also the daughter of a noble.

04:38.890 --> 04:40.050
Yes.

04:40.050 --> 04:43.330
<i>Nobles have it pretty rough themselves.</i>

04:44.010 --> 04:46.720
So, how far am I escorting?

04:46.720 --> 04:48.880
It's a village about two days away by carriage.

04:48.880 --> 04:52.180
They'll be responsible 
for delivering flour there.

04:52.180 --> 04:54.100
The entire trip should take four to five days.

04:54.100 --> 04:56.070
Four to five days, huh?

04:56.640 --> 04:59.490
Can Kumayuru and Kumakyu come along?

04:59.490 --> 05:02.920
Well, I don't want the students 
to feel too safe

05:02.920 --> 05:04.990
because they think the bears 
will protect them.

05:04.990 --> 05:06.700
What about as bear cubs?

05:06.700 --> 05:07.820
Bear cubs?

05:10.740 --> 05:11.800
Wh-What?!

05:11.800 --> 05:13.110
They're so cute!

05:13.110 --> 05:16.210
Are they Kumayuru and Kumakyu's children?!

05:16.210 --> 05:19.460
No, it's the people, I mean, 
the bears themselves.

05:19.460 --> 05:22.920
My summon beasts are special 
and can shrink in size.

05:24.260 --> 05:28.320
I'll be able to get through my practical 
with these guys by my side!

05:28.320 --> 05:29.090
What do you think?

05:29.090 --> 05:31.220
Well, it should be fine.

05:31.220 --> 05:32.570
All right!

05:32.570 --> 05:33.980
<i>Thank goodness.</i>

05:34.570 --> 05:37.460
<i>It'd be lonely not to see them 
for four or five days.</i>

05:44.030 --> 05:46.390
This is the academy?

05:46.790 --> 05:47.880
It's huge.

05:47.880 --> 05:50.130
Children ranging from common
 families in the capital

05:50.130 --> 05:52.660
to the families of nobles 
attend this academy.

05:52.660 --> 05:54.370
Is that so?

05:54.370 --> 05:59.180
Does that mean that there's 
a chance of having some normal students?

05:59.180 --> 06:01.630
You'll be escorting the sons of
the knights' captain, and prime minister,

06:01.630 --> 06:03.630
as well as the daughter of 
an upper-class noble.

06:03.960 --> 06:05.050
Can I go home?

06:05.050 --> 06:06.520
Nope.

06:19.870 --> 06:21.230
This is the bear...

06:21.900 --> 06:25.410
Erm, the adventurer that was 
personally chosen by Lady Ellalaura?

06:25.410 --> 06:29.200
Yes, I personally guarantee her capabilities.

06:30.400 --> 06:33.520
I understand. I believe in Lady Ellalaura.

06:34.160 --> 06:37.790
Now, Miss Yuna, I'll introduce you 
to the students you'll be escorting.

06:37.790 --> 06:39.160
Come in.

06:39.160 --> 06:40.500
Excuse us.

06:47.630 --> 06:49.530
<i>The energetic-looking boy with short hair</i>

06:49.530 --> 06:51.590
<i>is the son of the captain 
of the knights, Marix.</i>

06:52.030 --> 06:55.180
<i>The smart looking boy is the son 
of the prime minister, Timol.</i>

06:55.570 --> 06:58.640
<i>And the daughter of the upper-class 
noble family is Cattleya.</i>

06:59.000 --> 07:00.860
<i>At least, that's what Miss Ellalaura said.</i>

07:00.860 --> 07:03.020
Teacher, why is there a bear here?

07:03.020 --> 07:04.260
This bear...

07:05.260 --> 07:08.820
Erm, Miss Yuna is the adventurer 
that will follow you as your escort.

07:08.820 --> 07:11.240
Huh? What are you saying, Teacher?

07:11.240 --> 07:13.200
How in the world is this an adventurer?!

07:13.200 --> 07:14.370
Right, everyone?

07:14.370 --> 07:16.990
Th-That's right, Teacher.

07:16.990 --> 07:19.200
Please don't joke around with us.

07:19.200 --> 07:21.190
<i>I get it. I totally get it.</i>

07:21.190 --> 07:23.530
My, this is not a joke.

07:23.530 --> 07:27.140
She is the adventurer 
I personally requested to join us.

07:27.140 --> 07:28.340
But...

07:28.340 --> 07:33.470
Lady Ellalaura, 
may we confirm her guild card?

07:34.050 --> 07:36.500
My word is not enough for you?

07:36.500 --> 07:37.990
Th-That's not it.

07:37.990 --> 07:41.850
It's just that it's awfully hard to believe...

07:41.850 --> 07:43.690
It can't be helped.

07:44.230 --> 07:46.080
Yuna, will you please?

07:46.080 --> 07:46.940
Sure.

07:46.940 --> 07:48.610
Here you go.

07:48.610 --> 07:50.570
Job: Bear?

07:50.570 --> 07:51.980
Bear?

07:51.980 --> 07:53.030
Bear...

07:53.030 --> 07:54.700
Could this be <i>that</i> thing?

07:54.700 --> 07:55.740
Definitely.

07:56.150 --> 07:57.330
<i>That thing?</i>

07:57.330 --> 08:02.920
Lady Ellalaura, we're not responsible 
for what happens to her, correct?

08:03.330 --> 08:04.190
Yes.

08:04.630 --> 08:08.090
I'm fine with it, as long 
as we're not held responsible.

08:08.090 --> 08:13.670
Me, too. Even without an adventurer, 
we can handle this level of training.

08:13.670 --> 08:15.790
Are the two of you okay with this?

08:15.790 --> 08:19.410
Yes, I'll just consider this another 
part of our hands-on training.

08:19.410 --> 08:22.120
O-Of course I'm fine with it.

08:22.490 --> 08:24.690
<i>I want to go home.</i>

08:25.090 --> 08:27.960
It's been bothering me for a while.

08:27.960 --> 08:31.190
Why are there little bears here?

08:31.190 --> 08:33.130
They're my bears.

08:34.430 --> 08:36.190
She's even bringing pets?

08:36.190 --> 08:38.730
Where'd this spoiled young lady come from?

08:38.730 --> 08:40.240
Young lady?

08:49.730 --> 08:51.850
I'm so sorry about everything.

08:51.850 --> 08:53.800
Don't worry about it.

08:54.160 --> 08:57.300
By the way, what was "<i>that</i> thing" 
they were talking about?

08:57.300 --> 09:00.120
Oh. That's...

09:00.120 --> 09:03.110
They probably think that 
you're a rich and spoiled lady

09:03.110 --> 09:06.410
who bought her guild experience with money.

09:06.410 --> 09:07.850
Buy experience?

09:07.850 --> 09:12.290
Some people will hire high-leveled 
adventurers to form a party with them

09:12.290 --> 09:16.320
and gather false hunting 
results on their card.

09:17.000 --> 09:20.730
It sounds stupid, but there are people 
in the upper class who do things like that.

09:20.730 --> 09:22.290
I see.

09:23.410 --> 09:27.620
They thought I was a rich adventurer 
that took the easy way up.

09:28.070 --> 09:30.890
Looks like we're the last group.

09:30.890 --> 09:33.110
Let's get ready and go, Timol.

09:33.110 --> 09:34.020
Yeah.

09:34.020 --> 09:35.690
The last group?

09:35.690 --> 09:38.930
There are multiple groups 
participating in this hands-on training.

09:40.300 --> 09:44.030
I wonder what kind of adventurers 
are escorting the other groups.

09:44.030 --> 09:47.750
Cattleya. Shia. 
Cut the chatter and get ready!

09:47.750 --> 09:49.400
Hey, you.

09:49.400 --> 09:51.610
Don't get in our way.

09:53.320 --> 09:57.530
It'd be terrible if our score drops 
because of something stupid.

09:57.530 --> 09:58.740
<i>Annoying.</i>

09:58.740 --> 10:00.970
Both of you, don't be rude.

10:00.970 --> 10:05.210
We should be polite to a person 
who's kind enough to escort us.

10:05.210 --> 10:06.660
That's right.

10:07.060 --> 10:10.670
It doesn't matter why. 
Lady Ellalaura chose her.

10:10.670 --> 10:13.800
There's no need to be polite 
to someone playing adventurer.

10:15.420 --> 10:18.530
Let's prepare the carriage, Miss Yuna.

10:18.530 --> 10:19.590
Y-Yeah.

10:31.610 --> 10:36.030
Excuse me, may I touch your bears?

10:36.500 --> 10:38.240
Sure. Kumakyu.

10:42.040 --> 10:46.160
I always thought bears were scary, 
but these are so cute.

10:46.160 --> 10:48.580
Then, I'll hold on to Kumayuru.

10:49.920 --> 10:54.630
Let's head out of the royal capital. 
We'll change drivers in the afternoon.

10:54.630 --> 10:55.980
That sounds good.

10:55.980 --> 10:57.060
That's fine.

10:59.850 --> 11:03.920
<i>Just getting ready to go 
is making me exhausted.</i>

11:03.920 --> 11:05.630
<i>At times like this...</i>

11:05.630 --> 11:06.260
<i>Squeeze!</i>

11:07.720 --> 11:09.660
I feel like this will be a fun trip.

11:09.660 --> 11:11.090
This is so healing!

11:11.090 --> 11:14.190
<i>Where's my healing?</i>

11:16.440 --> 11:23.240
<b>Bear, Watching Over Students</b>

11:16.440 --> 11:23.240
<b>Bear, Watching Over Students</b>

11:41.550 --> 11:45.800
Welp, the first day went without a hitch.

11:45.800 --> 11:48.270
We're camping out in a place like this, huh?

11:49.320 --> 11:51.790
<i>I wish we could use the bear house.</i>

11:51.790 --> 11:54.230
Let's get started.

11:54.230 --> 11:55.810
I'll take care of the horses.

11:55.810 --> 11:58.030
I'll go find a source of water.

11:58.030 --> 12:00.690
The two of us will prepare our meals.

12:00.690 --> 12:03.560
I'll go and collect some firewood.

12:03.560 --> 12:08.100
Oh, yeah. Make sure you have someone 
with you when you go to the bathroom.

12:08.100 --> 12:09.010
Whoa...

12:09.010 --> 12:10.950
What a complete lack of delicacy.

12:10.950 --> 12:14.040
What? Didn't the teacher tell us to do that?!

12:14.040 --> 12:16.740
Okay, okay. Let's all start.

12:16.740 --> 12:19.090
Hey, wait! I'm not done talking!

12:22.010 --> 12:23.470
We'll take turns keeping watch.

12:23.470 --> 12:26.220
I'll go first, then Timol, Cattleya, and Shia.

12:26.220 --> 12:27.860
Make sure to rest properly.

12:27.860 --> 12:31.070
You'll have to do your shift properly, 
even if you can't sleep.

12:31.070 --> 12:32.450
Understood.

12:33.810 --> 12:37.020
<i>Since I'm not a part of the watch, 
I can just sleep, right?</i>

12:37.020 --> 12:42.640
<i>They're totally treating me 
like I don't exist.</i>

12:43.200 --> 12:44.940
I'll sleep outside.

12:44.940 --> 12:47.260
I appreciate that, Timol.

12:47.260 --> 12:50.760
It'd be difficult to sleep 
with a boy next to us.

12:50.760 --> 12:51.790
Let's sleep.

12:51.790 --> 12:52.700
Yes.

12:53.870 --> 12:55.080
Good night.

12:55.250 --> 12:56.830
Good night.

12:58.310 --> 13:00.080
Yeah, yeah. Come on.

13:00.600 --> 13:02.300
I'm so jealous...

13:02.300 --> 13:04.440
I'm not lending them to you. Good night.

13:06.710 --> 13:08.990
Good night, Kumayuru.

13:08.990 --> 13:12.970
Good night, Kumakyu.

13:15.560 --> 13:18.230
They must have been really tired.

13:18.590 --> 13:21.560
Tell me if any monsters or bandits attack.

13:23.800 --> 13:25.010
I'm depending on you two.

13:32.620 --> 13:35.230
Miss Shia, it's your turn.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.940
Got it...

13:43.870 --> 13:48.300
<i>Shia goes last, so it'll 
probably be morning soon.</i>

13:51.010 --> 13:52.010
Miss Yuna?

13:52.580 --> 13:55.940
It's a little lonely not 
being a part of the watch.

13:55.940 --> 13:57.850
I'll tag along with you until morning.

13:57.850 --> 13:59.520
Here's a gift.

14:00.820 --> 14:03.700
Kumayuru! You're so warm!

14:03.700 --> 14:06.570
It's pretty chilly right around dawn.

14:06.570 --> 14:09.330
Are you a little tired, Miss Yuna?

14:09.330 --> 14:12.050
Just a little, mentally.

14:12.050 --> 14:15.840
I didn't realize that spending time with 
boys around my age would be this exhausting.

14:17.040 --> 14:19.620
What about you and this outdoor practical?

14:20.340 --> 14:24.890
Well, I feel a little uneasy 
being outside the royal capital.

14:24.890 --> 14:27.880
Despite that, you've all been doing well.

14:28.260 --> 14:31.290
It's an honor to hear that 
from you, Miss Yuna.

14:33.030 --> 14:35.170
It's almost morning.

14:35.170 --> 14:37.720
Well, I have to wake everyone up.

14:37.720 --> 14:40.190
We want to reach our destination by nightfall.

14:40.920 --> 14:43.620
It's morning! Everyone, get up!

14:57.890 --> 14:58.710
Could it be?

14:59.100 --> 15:01.190
<i>Five monsters are intercepting us.</i>

15:01.190 --> 15:05.280
<i>Goblins. They're not very strong, but...</i>

15:08.010 --> 15:11.430
Looks like Kumayuru and Kumakyu 
are sensing monsters nearby.

15:11.770 --> 15:14.520
Huh? They can tell something like that?

15:14.520 --> 15:17.000
These two are special.

15:17.000 --> 15:20.330
So, is this something 
I should tell everyone about?

15:20.330 --> 15:26.030
Well, let's tell them this time 
so everyone has more faith in you.

15:26.030 --> 15:26.650
You sure?

15:26.650 --> 15:31.380
It's better to tell everyone that 
the bears have a skill like that.

15:31.380 --> 15:34.740
It would be terrible if the others 
didn't believe you in an emergency.

15:34.740 --> 15:38.080
<i>Wow, as expected of Shia. 
She's quick to make decisions.</i>

15:38.080 --> 15:39.870
Cattleya, wake up!

15:39.870 --> 15:41.630
Timol, stop the carriage!

15:41.630 --> 15:43.310
There are monsters nearby!

15:43.910 --> 15:46.210
Huh? What? Monsters?

15:43.910 --> 15:46.210
What? Monsters?! Where?!

15:47.940 --> 15:49.330
There aren't any monsters around.

15:49.330 --> 15:53.330
Miss Yuna's bears are telling us 
that there are monsters nearby.

15:54.460 --> 15:56.700
The bear's bears?

15:56.700 --> 15:58.120
There are five monsters.

15:58.120 --> 16:01.180
They're telling me that they're 
coming from that part of the forest.

16:04.270 --> 16:07.730
Marix, animals can be good at 
sniffing these kinds of things out.

16:07.730 --> 16:10.120
They're able to do something like that?

16:10.120 --> 16:14.950
Yup. These guys warn me about danger, 
making it easier to escort you guys.

16:14.950 --> 16:19.540
Doesn't that mean your bears 
are amazing, but you're not?

16:19.540 --> 16:20.990
Marix!

16:22.000 --> 16:24.960
Fine. Prepare for battle just in case.

16:28.380 --> 16:29.880
What?! There are really monsters?!

16:30.970 --> 16:35.680
<i>They were surprised, 
but didn't have any problems.</i>

16:37.140 --> 16:41.320
<i>Their inexperienced movements 
were a little haphazard,</i>

16:41.320 --> 16:45.670
<i>but they managed to take 
care of all the goblins.</i>

16:46.980 --> 16:48.820
We won!

16:48.820 --> 16:50.210
That magic was amazing!

16:50.210 --> 16:51.950
That was easy!

16:51.950 --> 16:54.950
But I didn't think there'd really be goblins.

16:54.950 --> 16:59.660
Looks like this proves that the bears 
can really sense monsters.

17:00.340 --> 17:01.950
Wasn't that just a coincidence?

17:01.950 --> 17:04.220
They even knew the number of goblins.

17:04.220 --> 17:08.860
Since it's a such coincidence, how about 
you coincidentally find some next?

17:08.860 --> 17:11.980
Fine! I believe it. I believe it!

17:23.730 --> 17:26.350
Thanks, I guess.

17:26.350 --> 17:27.260
Oh?

17:27.810 --> 17:30.820
Just so you know, 
I'm only thanking your bears!

17:30.820 --> 17:32.840
It's got nothing to do with you!

17:33.860 --> 17:35.620
<i>Is he a tsundere?</i>

17:41.580 --> 17:48.110
<i>Come to think of it, these goblins 
looked pretty desperate for some reason.</i>

17:48.110 --> 17:49.720
<i>Was it my imagination?</i>

17:53.120 --> 17:54.420
We're here.

17:54.420 --> 17:57.380
Let's all greet the people in the village.

17:58.670 --> 17:59.710
Hey, that's...

17:59.710 --> 18:00.430
A bear?

18:00.430 --> 18:01.060
Huh?

18:01.060 --> 18:02.190
It's a bear.

18:02.190 --> 18:02.910
A bear?

18:02.910 --> 18:04.140
She's so cute!

18:04.140 --> 18:06.100
Is that how they dress
up at the royal capital?

18:06.100 --> 18:08.060
Why is she dressed like that?

18:08.060 --> 18:09.290
I want to hug her!

18:08.510 --> 18:11.540
<i>I know. I know...</i>

18:12.590 --> 18:19.130
Welcome to our village. 
I am the village chief, Cabos.

18:19.130 --> 18:21.460
I'm from the academy. My name is Marix.

18:21.460 --> 18:24.080
We've brought your goods in our carriage.

18:24.080 --> 18:28.540
<i>Oh! He's conceited, but he's
 polite when he needs to be.</i>

18:28.540 --> 18:31.890
We'll take care of the goods 
and your carriage.

18:31.890 --> 18:34.380
Please stay at my house for the night.

18:34.380 --> 18:37.320
Your adventurer escort is 
welcome to stay as well.

18:37.320 --> 18:38.960
Thank you very much.

18:38.960 --> 18:44.310
Um, this adorable bear lady is your...?

18:44.310 --> 18:46.700
Yes, more or less...

18:48.110 --> 18:49.300
I see.

18:52.190 --> 18:54.420
What a nice bath.

18:54.420 --> 18:55.570
Even so...

18:56.330 --> 18:58.840
You even have bear pajamas.

18:58.840 --> 19:03.170
Miss Yuna, you're so cute. 
You should try wearing other clothes.

19:04.280 --> 19:08.500
By the way, it seems that Miss Shia 
and Miss Yuna are acquaintances?

19:12.610 --> 19:13.420
Wha...

19:13.420 --> 19:15.460
What are you talking about?

19:16.940 --> 19:20.130
Miss Shia already knew Kumayuru's name

19:20.130 --> 19:22.320
even though she should have met 
you for the first time yesterday.

19:22.320 --> 19:23.220
What?!

19:23.220 --> 19:27.060
The two of you kept watch together, too.

19:27.060 --> 19:28.520
<i>I admit defeat.</i>

19:28.520 --> 19:31.100
<i>This girl is really good at 
observing her surroundings.</i>

19:31.100 --> 19:33.830
Keep it a secret from Marix and Timol.

19:33.830 --> 19:36.560
That's my personal mission 
on this hands-on training.

19:36.560 --> 19:39.580
Is that so? I'm sorry for saying anything.

19:39.580 --> 19:42.810
No, I just wasn't careful enough.

19:42.810 --> 19:48.040
I have to think of a plan to make sure 
that the other two don't find out!

19:48.040 --> 19:49.440
I'll help!

19:49.440 --> 19:50.950
Thank you!

20:11.800 --> 20:13.700
Sorry for calling so late at night.

20:14.390 --> 20:17.980
No, I was still awake.

20:17.980 --> 20:22.270
And I was looking forward to 
talking to you, Yuna Sis.

20:23.030 --> 20:25.110
How's work?

20:25.580 --> 20:30.320
<i>Well, it's super troublesome. 
I shouldn't have accepted the job.</i>

20:30.320 --> 20:32.080
But it sounds like you're having fun.

20:32.080 --> 20:33.060
Huh?

20:33.060 --> 20:39.050
<i>You were so depressed when you left Crimonia,
 but you seem okay now.</i>

20:39.050 --> 20:40.420
Really?

20:41.690 --> 20:43.380
Yeah, maybe you're right.

20:43.720 --> 20:48.470
In the beginning, I judged the noble 
kids through my own tinted glasses.

20:49.430 --> 20:51.890
But they worked harder than I expected.

20:52.270 --> 20:56.010
<i>Even then, I've wanted to 
go home many times.</i>

20:56.010 --> 20:59.440
<i>I've managed to pull through thanks to Shia.</i>

21:00.460 --> 21:02.890
I'm glad Lady Shia is with you.

21:04.520 --> 21:08.990
Um, I wish we could talk more,

21:08.990 --> 21:11.680
but I know you have work tomorrow.

21:12.360 --> 21:15.120
Good night, Yuna Sis.

21:15.120 --> 21:17.040
Work hard tomorrow, too.

21:17.040 --> 21:18.050
Yeah.

21:19.970 --> 21:21.610
Good night, Fina.

23:35.390 --> 23:40.010
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.390 --> 23:40.010
<b>Bear, Surprising All</b>

23:36.040 --> 23:37.320
Bear?
